message: >-
  If grokbot-x earns a star from you, that is payment enough.
  If you use it in something you ship, cite it — and post your SkillOpt
  receipt in Discussions.
title: grokbot-x
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yannis
    family-names: Kiefer
    website: "https://ecombrain.io/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=grokbot-x&utm_campaign=oss&utm_content=citation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YannisKiefer/grokbot-x"
url: "https://yanniskiefer.github.io/grokbot-x/"
abstract: >-
  Self-learning X growth agent for Grok Bot: scouts posts with views far
  above author follower counts, drafts replies and originals in the
  operator's voice, publishes through the official Typefully API with a
  human approving every reply, and runs a nightly SkillOpt gate that keeps
  a skill edit only when held-out data proves it better. Python standard
  library only.
